  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Adhesive Foam Sponge Strip Roll is highly versatile due to its excellent sealing, shock absorption, and adhesive properties. It can be applied to the bottom of models to prevent sliding on smooth surfaces, ensuring stability for display models or items that need secure placement. Additionally, the sealing capabilities of adhesive foam can be useful in multiple applications such as filament dry boxes, etc. to extend the shelf life of water-absorbing materials in humid environments."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Feature"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Leaves no residue or contamination on equipment and is non-corrosive to metals | Suitable for temperature ranges from -40℃ to 90℃ | Easy to adhere, fabricate, and cut"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Noise reduction, gap filling, sealing, dustproofing, shock absorption, and light blocking | Safe and eco-friendly with high flame resistance"
    }
  ],
